{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>And they shall not bear iniquity and die.</b> Rashi's comment: this teaches that one who officiates lacking the garments is liable to death. And that passage 'these are those who are burned' which concludes 'the avnet set them apart — lacking the garments is liable to death' — one may answer that this verse does not refer only to the מכנסים, which are placed above it."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {0 "The talmudic passage referenced is Yoma 72b; 'one who officiates lacking the garments is liable to death' is Rashi's own formulation on this verse, which Chizkuni cites."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:01.662822110Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}